      {"expr": "sum by (parent_agent,agent,subagent) (observatory_rework_loops_by_context_total{event_type=~\"$event_type\",project=~\"$project\",repository=~\"$repository\",branch=~\"$branch\",agent=~\"$agent\",subagent=~\"$subagent\",parent_agent=~\"$parent_agent\"})", "legendFormat": "rework loops / {{parent_agent}} / {{agent}} / {{subagent}}", "refId": "B"}
    ]},
    {"type": "text", "id": 4, "title": "Evidence boundary", "gridPos": {"h": 6, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 27}, "options": {"mode": "markdown", "content": "Parent-agent, agent, and subagent labels are retained only when the source reports them. Missing hierarchy is `unknown`; this view does not infer ownership or causality. Raw prompts, tool arguments, paths, commands, results, and test payloads remain excluded by default. Use the event detail and attribution APIs for high-cardinality drill-down."}}
